  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fxaeros-world-map-excalibur-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur-xaeros-world-map-support\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>這是一個<strong>非官方兼容包</strong>，旨在將<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's World Map</a>模塊的外觀與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a>資源包對齊。此包已<strong>100%完成</strong>，包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>重新設計所有GUI按鈕。</li>\n<li>移除右上角的NESW方向標記。</li>\n<li>支持<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/open-parties-and-claims\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Open Parties and Claims</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>注意：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>為了獲得最佳體驗，請配合<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a>使用此包。</li>\n<li>如需提交Bug報告或建議，請在<strong>Discord上私信我（@thedatthai）</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>致謝：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/maffhew\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Maffhew</a> - Excalibur創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/xaero96\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">xaero96</a> - Xaero's World Map創作者</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/grandpappyjay\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GrandPappyJay</a> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/clarent-excalibur-patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clarent Edition</a>中航點和指針的紋理陰影處理</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tc_/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TC_</a> - 縮略圖靈感來源</li>\n</ul>",
